{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:welcomeImportFooterNote", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "welcomeImportFooterNote", "text": "Raw sensor exports, an OpenStrap backup (encrypted or not), or a vendor CSV. Imported days sit alongside days this app measured and feed the same baselines — but a day the band already measured is never overwritten.", "sha256": "b07090cf1ec883e80079bec46b5400717e5cde740deb00736b367aeec59030a7", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:welcomeChoosePassphrase", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "welcomeChoosePassphrase", "text": "Choose a passphrase", "sha256": "0ef9a424bd9dd1517f5d9f5ecee676ca5b886838f2e83aa235d80cdafc31599d", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:welcomePassphrase", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "welcomePassphrase", "text": "Passphrase", "sha256": "e7611f0537df5fc5d0177da520628219fccf065a1d4176cfbde2f75d824821f4", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:welcomePassphraseCreateNote", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "welcomePassphraseCreateNote", "text": "The file is unreadable without it. And a forgotten passphrase means that backup is gone — there is no recovery, because there is no account and no server holding a key. That is the same thing that keeps it private.", "sha256": "e162b5118a5a15211469713f271dc1ccf01ebc53ad119aa64256ac3edcdfba0b", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:welcomePassphraseOpenNote", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "welcomePassphraseOpenNote", "text": "The one you chose when this backup was written.", "sha256": "2235c80e1a9efaef0eb6de60faaa30bca396c7628bee422d5233b28def0d1345", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:welcomeRepeatIt", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "welcomeRepeatIt", "text": "Repeat it", "sha256": "53e1e43303996ada7507edd13e66ac8269609a59ec7b51b9c990d922f3c9cc1b", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:welcomeEncrypt", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "welcomeEncrypt", "text": "Encrypt", "sha256": "4f03bf1cdf8e7d1882e5198384139c078fa527857e7371ac6cb2d030dede15a3", "kind": "arb"}
