{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:scanBarcodeTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "scanBarcodeTitle", "text": "Scan the barcode", "sha256": "36628a0cdd7a5fed46b3cdb0d81bc390d6786f3e0300998ffa51aa476f1269bd", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:scanBarcodeClose", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "scanBarcodeClose", "text": "Close", "sha256": "7d9eb7acb13e24625c404401d8e88b2350e32162455885f18276cf802f7701ed", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:scanBarcodeInstructions", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "scanBarcodeInstructions", "text": "Hold the barcode inside the frame. Nothing is recorded — the digits are all this reads.", "sha256": "00fff35c36984018318459f0a0866821cae8d46ff4b8ce33d298c0b350c1aa78", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:scanBarcodeNoAccessTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "scanBarcodeNoAccessTitle", "text": "No camera access", "sha256": "d57cf93dc17d556201d4a234c7a1e544b9d8c25544e057e516d2b1b95c26c47a", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:scanBarcodeCameraFailedTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "scanBarcodeCameraFailedTitle", "text": "The camera did not start", "sha256": "1f7585d662c00848585c8ddd2617b8beba58a3fd1f387ec8dc11aeb6b92dbdf3", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:scanBarcodeNoAccessBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "scanBarcodeNoAccessBody", "text": "Scanning needs the camera, and this app has not been given it.", "sha256": "bffab3b58179709f63993f64252ef39c6ab6d85d025df453fbf42083e62856cf", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:scanBarcodeCameraFailedBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "scanBarcodeCameraFailedBody", "text": "This device would not open its camera for the scanner.", "sha256": "95579bc9611e70c33331d973f8a09b1f06b6cde1517ea553f14de5a9027a8b3b", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:scanBarcodeTypeInstead", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "scanBarcodeTypeInstead", "text": "Type the numbers instead", "sha256": "54c0204cfbb67ee5bc080325818476f20e88286b4880c65c64fe2a1211301364", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:findingsLogTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "findingsLogTitle", "text": "Observations", "sha256": "f87558869bcf88160fa9759243c01390751a4a5ae7ae28ebf760a4c416351bac", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:findingsLogEmptyTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "findingsLogEmptyTitle", "text": "Nothing has stood out", "sha256": "ca66caec66d73f563a5f58cff43b6cbba898ddce4019acd42ac653dd6b8803e8", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:findingsLogEmptyBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "findingsLogEmptyBody", "text": "The watches for illness, unusual overnight physiology, skin temperature and a shift in your resting heart rate have all been quiet. That is an outcome, not an empty screen.", "sha256": "1b43be43dbe33a757c05c4b61504256ebaa6f1dd7f437de711658a815b588fb2", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:findingsLogDerivedNote", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "findingsLogDerivedNote", "text": "Worked out from your own days each time this opens, not written down when it happened — so if a day is re-analysed, what it says here changes with it.", "sha256": "6c55e71e6a0c3a3193ac24877c10a8039549222fe75d0a57f3d656327caa496a", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:startCardDefaultSub", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "startCardDefaultSub", "text": "Pick one and go", "sha256": "bf5c7956de2bca285fb01f0c6f85744c121fd6bc7bfd88f34a12984fe7dc2040", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:monthGridCoverage", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "monthGridCoverage", "text": "{have} of {total} days", "sha256": "0b520c40afa6b933b3cad0e935c7d0de7548643d3654f48cbaba3c55f04f70ab", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:monthGridSemanticsLabel", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "monthGridSemanticsLabel", "text": "{title}: {have} of {total} days have a value. Shaded against your own range.", "sha256": "7f0235b49c300bc2e315a4eaf0f28c30834fa259f49596254d424abe91a8b050", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:monthGridDaysAgo", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "monthGridDaysAgo", "text": "{days} days ago", "sha256": "cd9bdc3a9f2665ed949a75746c472fae14c430f5ee314b8a07a79808b253dca2", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:monthGridToday", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "monthGridToday", "text": "Today", "sha256": "2b065c7c9ce466e5ebcad757987d5d660ee4c9ea708bc62c43444b53334738ba", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:monthGridFootnote", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "monthGridFootnote", "text": "One cell per day. Darker is further up YOUR own range — the 10th to 90th percentile of every day you have stored — and an outlined cell is a day with no value, not a low one. More strain is not better strain and longer sleep is not healthier sleep; this says where a day sat, not how it went.", "sha256": "3ee21c7222c38e4a18654b3b67f66575c52846eae986fa8569cb479c3083cf0d", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:monthGridNotShadedYetTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "monthGridNotShadedYetTitle", "text": "{title} is not shaded yet", "sha256": "cc289ec384f9477f0e7762a25ce35eac79d6661f2ae38c01c4b7f1e5a0986939", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:monthGridNotShadedYetBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "monthGridNotShadedYetBody", "text": "{days, plural, one{{days} day} other{{days} days}} is not a range — a shade is where a day sits in your own range. It appears at {min}.", "sha256": "6785c871c6ece8e85ba33df55073c64a6a410e85bfa96694bdfe34eded9977d4", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:whatChangedTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "whatChangedTitle", "text": "What changed", "sha256": "1bcbf1dcad4ffe4950cdae6b868f8a81fabe5f9da2d92abc3cef577e25fee639", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:whatChangedSub", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "whatChangedSub", "text": "AGAINST YOUR OWN HISTORY", "sha256": "4ef0dd09708ecf5810d69e722851064b5a388956242f013f3c1547debe6af9e4", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:whatChangedNoDataTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "whatChangedNoDataTitle", "text": "Nothing has landed for this day yet", "sha256": "28d8ed281cba377abade0028b41b353f4e2c27fce5d4c9ec75d7196105b339e2", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:whatChangedNoDataBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "whatChangedNoDataBody", "text": "The sweep compares a day against the ones before it, and this day has no value to compare. Nothing about it is unusual because nothing about it is known.", "sha256": "731e19c595aaf9378937ea7890ddaf6793c374a1fe507105df1e36f760317762", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:whatChangedLearningTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "whatChangedLearningTitle", "text": "Still learning your usual", "sha256": "0a67aacb1e60a79665d0ca550e78f0d87a0a4d38329f9fdf84d6ec947dd90577", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:whatChangedLearningBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "whatChangedLearningBody", "text": "Unusual only means anything against a range, and there {days, plural, one{is {days} day} other{are {days} days}} of history behind this one. The sweep starts at {min}.", "sha256": "8d753671782299a056b5be858b8699517768d10b37a38c14250d8c6fa1926f79", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:whatChangedNothingTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "whatChangedNothingTitle", "text": "Nothing stood out", "sha256": "b62d945e01724eecf9484014bef0070fc1fb301783ee477cf0ccdcfc2717b1a1", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:whatChangedNothingBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "whatChangedNothingBody", "text": "Every metric with enough history sat inside the range your own days have set. That is the normal answer, and it is a complete one.", "sha256": "b6cf795d49128df1072f59830a07a1ed262ebae66c3e638bd838b7764fc64a2d", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:whatChangedMethodologyNote", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "whatChangedMethodologyNote", "text": "Measured against your own trailing days, in your own units, with the window attached — so you can disbelieve it. Nothing here is a cause and nothing here is a diagnosis.", "sha256": "7a2921aa1ade383262b6ce2f095dfc80534b7127beb2d3b490a045a7af2f6917", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:whatChangedDayLinkTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "whatChangedDayLinkTitle", "text": "What happened that day", "sha256": "343b964940c9dd05e1407c2159c9e0585bdb31383ef124fc5f7f389043704d98", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:whatChangedDayLinkSub", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "whatChangedDayLinkSub", "text": "Sleep, sessions, meals and logs in time order", "sha256": "04f9afeceb336c118b1fda71b5aeb88400c6a002f6c6a2452e0184ec5cb4a486", "kind": "arb"}
