{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:aiBriefingNoneBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "aiBriefingNoneBody", "text": "Nothing. There was no request — the note above was written on this phone.", "sha256": "ffcc87f960c45fd6d7506457d2d5ee084f88a9712169784694b343244f135d20", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:aiBriefingLocalBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "aiBriefingLocalBody", "text": "These numbers went to {host}, on this machine. Nothing left it.", "sha256": "a91efa795db30a5415a51f751de8913cb2b3ae2e61a4858815294e7c6eebae6c", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:aiBriefingCloudBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "aiBriefingCloudBody", "text": "These numbers, and nothing else, were sent to {host} as {model}. No raw recordings, no name, no identifier.", "sha256": "1d743073dee9ca17c5772c854c44014033fd5a3373346bb6c6e07a2adac762e2", "kind": "arb"}
